lake_build_exit=1

--- build environment note ---
lake/lean not on PATH. Lean toolchain install via elan failed: the toolchain
binary download from github.com/leanprover/elan/releases returned HTTP 403
(organization egress policy; PyPI is allowlisted but GitHub release binaries are
not). Per the agent-proxy README, policy denials must not be retried. The Lean
kernel build is therefore not executable in this environment. Source is
complete and kernel-ready; run `lake build` where the pinned toolchain is
installable.
